window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-143-9578993c24ff9d3c.json"]={sha256:"9578993c24ff9d3c8bdf88fff852219cd57b6e78edf30da21e42fb4fc81b687f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-143","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-143","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-144","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en"],"title":"雙向 OTDR：消除熔接假增益","titleEn":"Bidirectional OTDR: eliminate apparent splice gain","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學定位容差0.1 km；若另一端推算不一致，保留疑點，不用最大峰直接判定斷纖。 trace.csv、launch_offset.json與雙向里程對照表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 10 與變更 12 km、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-143 --out ./comm-v28-143-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching location tolerance0.1 km; keep the result unresolved if reverse-end localization disagrees, rather than declaring the largest peak a break. trace.csv, launch_offset.json and bidirectional distance reconciliation Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 10 and changed 12 km, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-143 --out ./comm-v28-143-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學熔接容許0.3 dB；名義0.2通過，變更0.4需復查；單向負值不作通過依據。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching splice limit0.3 dB:0.2 passes and0.4 needs review; a negative one-way reading is not a pass criterion.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成群速度2.0e8 m/s，發射零點校正後事件延遲100 µs；第二組120 µs；先扣除引線。 名義式 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km；變更式 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 由距離反算往返時間；建立0、5、10 km三個已知標記檢查斜率與零點，再比較從另一端量測的位置。","合成A→B熔接0.8 dB、B→A為−0.4 dB；變更為0.9與−0.1 dB。 名義式 (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB；變更式 (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 反向座標換算到同一物理熔接，再平均；以穿透式損耗量測檢查總路徑，不能平均不對應事件。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic group velocity2.0e8 m/s and launch-corrected event delays100 and120 µs; subtract the launch fiber first. Nominal 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km; changed 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Reconstruct round-trip time from distance; use known0,5,10 km markers for slope and offset and compare the opposite-end coordinate.","Synthetic A-to-B splice0.8 dB and reverse−0.4 dB; changed readings0.9 and−0.1 dB. Nominal (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB; changed (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Map reverse coordinates to the same physical splice before averaging; verify total insertion loss and never average different events.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-153","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en"],"title":"雙偏振 QPSK：線速與淨資料率","titleEn":"Dual-polarization QPSK: gross and net data rate","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學定位容差0.1 km；若另一端推算不一致，保留疑點，不用最大峰直接判定斷纖。 trace.csv、launch_offset.json與雙向里程對照表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 10 與變更 12 km、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-143 --out ./comm-v28-143-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching location tolerance0.1 km; keep the result unresolved if reverse-end localization disagrees, rather than declaring the largest peak a break. trace.csv, launch_offset.json and bidirectional distance reconciliation Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 10 and changed 12 km, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-143 --out ./comm-v28-143-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學服務需至少120 Gbit/s；32 GBd組不足，40 GBd組達標但不代表光學誤碼已驗收。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching service requires120 Gbit/s;32 GBd is insufficient and40 GBd meets rate only, not optical BER acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成群速度2.0e8 m/s，發射零點校正後事件延遲100 µs；第二組120 µs；先扣除引線。 名義式 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km；變更式 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 由距離反算往返時間；建立0、5、10 km三個已知標記檢查斜率與零點，再比較從另一端量測的位置。","合成32 GBd、有效負載比例0.80；變更至40 GBd而維持相同比例。 名義式 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s；變更式 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用1 ns時間窗列兩偏振符號數與編碼位元，再扣明示冗餘；以符號數守恆核對。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic group velocity2.0e8 m/s and launch-corrected event delays100 and120 µs; subtract the launch fiber first. Nominal 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km; changed 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Reconstruct round-trip time from distance; use known0,5,10 km markers for slope and offset and compare the opposite-end coordinate.","Synthetic32 GBd and0.80 payload fraction; change to40 GBd with the same fraction. Nominal 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s; changed 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Count symbols and coded bits on both polarizations in a1 ns window, then remove stated redundancy; reconcile symbol counts.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-941dfb38670077d1","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en","title":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","titleEn":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
